 &lt;div class="score-action-menu" data-score-role="oefenen"&gt;&lt;p class="score-action-help" role="tooltip"&gt;Speel mee in Coria: stemmen kiezen, tempo en meelezen op de partituur. Dit is bedoeld om echt te oefenen.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a class="btn coria-play" href="https://coria.nl/play_from_url?back=coria.nl&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2Forthodox-ronl%2Fbibliotheek%2Fgh-pages%2Fwerkbank%2Fmxl%2Fc%2F4f3e9dae2e36.musicxml" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Oefenen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
